/// Appends two read-only arrays of i32, returning a new Vec<i32>
/// that is the concatenation of `a` followed by `b`.
///
/// Specifications:
/// - Length of output is a.len() + b.len()
/// - For all i in [0, a.len()), output[i] == a[i]
